{"ver": "0.1", "info": {"id": "wsScRt", "date": "1587140421", "viewed": 90, "name": "glsl [-X-]", "username": "makkotech", "description": "https://twitter.com/darandy\n\n\u3064\u3076\u3084\u304dGLSL\uff06Gaming Cube\u89e3\u8aac\uff1f\uff08\u4e0b\u66f8\u304d\uff09\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/fanbox/creator/34219572/post/968500?utm_campaign=manage_post_page&utm_medium=share&utm_source=twitter", "likes": 3, "published": 1, "flags": 0, "usePreview": 0, "tags": ["intro"], "hasliked": 0, "parentid": "", "parentname": ""}, "renderpass": [{"inputs": [], "outputs": [{"id": "4dfGRr", "channel": 0}], "code": "#define R(_)\\\n\tmat2(\\\n    \t2.0,\\\n      \t(sin(t)/cos(t))\\\n        -sin(2.5),\\\n         sin(t)/cos(t)\\\n        -sin(2.5)\\\n    ,2.0)\n\nvoid mainImage( out vec4 fragColor, in vec2 fragCoord )\n{\n    float t = iTime;\n    vec2 r = iResolution.xy;\n\tvec2 p=(gl_FragCoord.xy*2.-r)/min(r.y,r.x);\n    for(int i=0;i<4;++i){\n        p=abs(p)-0.34;p*=R(t);\n    }\n    float v = 1.0/(p.y)*(5.0/-log(p.y/.3));\n    fragColor = vec4(v*vec3(1.0,1.0,1.0),1);\n}", "name": "Image", "description": "", "type": "image"}]}